direction: right
title: Local Cache (Caffeine) vs Distributed Cache (Redis)

Local: Local Cache (Caffeine) {
  style.fill: "#0B132B"
  style.stroke: "#0284C7"
  pod1: "Pod 1 (Heap: Price $100)"
  pod2: "Pod 2 (Heap: Price $90 STALE)"
  perf: "~50ns latency; zero network"
  issue: "Inter-node divergence"
}

Dist: Distributed Cache (Redis) {
  style.fill: "#06201B"
  style.stroke: "#10B981"
  p1: Pod 1
  p2: Pod 2
  redis: Central Redis Cluster
  p1 -> redis: Shared state
  p2 -> redis: Shared state
  perf: "~1ms latency; cluster-wide consistent"
}
